{
  "title": "Payments — Autocancelamento de boleto (Event Storming)",
  "description": "Gerado do Event Storming 'boleto-auto-cancellation' pelo skill event-storming. Não edite à mão: altere o spec e gere de novo.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "tags": [
    "team:payments"
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "default": "development"
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "default": "payments-api"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Autocancelamento de boleto**\n\nDono: Christiano Milfont (dono do sinal e Tech Lead). Alinhar o que acontece do boleto emitido até o consumidor saber que ele foi cancelado por vencimento, e fechar o contrato do webhook.\n\n",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Sinais disponíveis",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Webhooks do PSP recebidos",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:webhook.received{env:$env.value,service:$service.value}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Falhas no processamento de webhooks",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:webhook.failed{env:$env.value,service:$service.value}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Webhooks do PSP ao longo do tempo",
              "show_legend": false,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:webhook.received{env:$env.value,service:$service.value}.as_count()",
                  "display_type": "bars"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Boletos expirados",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:invoice.expired{env:$env.value,service:$service.value}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "invoice.cancelled entregue ao consumidor",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:webhook.delivery.sent{env:$env.value,service:$service.value,event:invoice.cancelled}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "Falhas de entrega de invoice.cancelled",
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:webhook.delivery.failed{env:$env.value,service:$service.value,event:invoice.cancelled}.as_count()",
                  "aggregator": "sum"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Expirações ignoradas",
              "show_legend": false,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:invoice.expiration_ignored{env:$env.value,service:$service.value}.as_count()",
                  "display_type": "bars"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**SLIs propostos**\n\n| SLI | Meta |\n|---|---|\n| Atraso OVERDUE → webhook entregue (p95) | [apurar] |\n| Taxa de entrega de invoice.cancelled | [apurar] |",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
